{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>playing in the habitable world</b> — It is possible to interpret that this verse is the explanation of what was said above. He said: playing in the habitable world, which is His earth, meaning playing before Him at all times, and <b>my delights were with the children of men</b> means and I was delights day by day." "<b>the children of men</b> — like עם בני אדם (with the children of men). And the reason: for they are the receivers and she is the emanator, and the delight is equal in both of them."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:34.707752354Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}